00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.020
The battle is already over!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.150
It's not over.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:54.860
Exterminate the Gundams and all Federation mobile suits...

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.440
What's happening?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:38.530
Even the Vagan mobile suits are helping Kio.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.490
We've almost finished cutting it away!

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:09.020
This is the end!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.430
Kio...

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:46.060
Kio!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.240
That boy...

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.540
Kio did it, didn't he?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.750
Yes. That's Kio Asuno.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.040
My grandson! {d'awww}{my mango}

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.550
Kio... well done.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:23.720
Well done, Kio! Well done, Kio! {whoa i almost forgot Haro existed in this show}{how could you forget? don't you remember THORA's ED karaoke?}

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:45.830
Dorene... I didn't want to fight a war.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:54.580
I just wanted to make a new world, where people could live like humans.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:57.300
But...

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:02.180
Darling... the world is going to change anyway.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.760
Thanks to that boy.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:15.190
That's right. I still think he might be Romy reborn.

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:21.150
Yes. Perhaps that's why he taught us

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:24.450
about the human kindness we'd almost forgotten.

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:27.660
Yes.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:29.830
Kio...

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.460
Mr. Ezelcant?

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.540
Thank you, Kio.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:39.380
I entrust the Earth to you.{like it's yours to entrust...}

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:48.640
Please show me... a future where people can be human.

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:04.570
People will still keep on living.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.280
Hand in hand...

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.370
I know it.

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.080
Here ended a battle.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:23.340
Soon after, humanity gathered data 
from the AGE system and the EXA-DB

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:27.430
to develop the Everse System, which nullified the Mars Rays.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:32.390
Thus, the Mars Sphere became a safe place to live,

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:38.730
and humanity finally had enough 
space to house its entire population.

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:46.030
It was 37 years after the Battle of La Gramis.

